    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open World Multiplayer Drifting</h2><br><i>The game is in early access and still under development. Skid Island is not a complete game.</i><br><br><br><strong>Drift around on Skid Island together with your friends, on Windows, Linux and Android!</strong><br><br>Drive around:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Drift, jump and drive fast to make money<br></li><li>6 &quot;Driftparks&quot; with lots of space and layouts for drifting<br></li><li>Set highscores in drift zone challenges</li></ul><br>Buy and customize new cars:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Buy a new ride with your earned cash<br></li><li>Paint your car<br></li><li>Install a spoiler</li></ul><br>Other features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Limited (Logitech) wheel support<br></li><li>Limited controller support<br></li><li>Visual vehicle damage</li></ul><br><br>This is what's available so far. There are many features that aren't ready to be implemented yet, and some are still in planning phase.<br>For more details on development progress, visit our website, or join the discord!",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open World Multiplayer Drifting</h2><br><i>The game is in early access and still under development. Skid Island is not a complete game.</i><br><br><br><strong>Drift around on Skid Island together with your friends, on Windows, Linux and Android!</strong><br><br>Drive around:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Drift, jump and drive fast to make money<br></li><li>6 &quot;Driftparks&quot; with lots of space and layouts for drifting<br></li><li>Set highscores in drift zone challenges</li></ul><br>Buy and customize new cars:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Buy a new ride with your earned cash<br></li><li>Paint your car<br></li><li>Install a spoiler</li></ul><br>Other features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Limited (Logitech) wheel support<br></li><li>Limited controller support<br></li><li>Visual vehicle damage</li></ul><br><br>This is what's available so far. There are many features that aren't ready to be implemented yet, and some are still in planning phase.<br>For more details on development progress, visit our website, or join the discord!",
    "short_description": "Drift, jump and be fast, make cash and tune your cars! Upgrade your ride for smoother drifts and challenge other players.",
